  Pick how cyrus reaches you

> 1. Quick tunnel (cloudflared)
     Instant, no signup. The link can change on restart, so you might
re-run setup once in a while.
  2. Stable tunnel (ngrok) — recommended
     A permanent link from one free ngrok signup. Set it once, forget
it.
  3. My own domain (cloudflared)
     Advanced — you already run a named cloudflared tunnel.

  Press enter to choose · esc to go back
